                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is a **^^Wizard^^**, add 1 to its power level for the rest of the turn. If this unit is not a **^^Wizard^^**, it gains **^^Wizard (1)^^** for the rest of the turn.
In addition, add 2 to the next casting roll or banishment roll for this unit this turn.</characteristic>
