                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle, while enemy units are contesting the target objective, those units cannot use **^^Run^^**, **^^Retreat^^** or **^^Charge^^** abilities.</characteristic>
