                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to your opponent&apos;s **fury level**. For each 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
