                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can spend 1 **rage dice**. If you do:
• Apply the effect below.
• If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. 
Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the effect below.
For the rest of the turn, ignore negative modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Idoneth Deepkin^^** units that target that enemy unit.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
